// Lexical weight stays 64 unless a pairs file fits it.
// A pair is a query and one catalog line.
// The fit does not store a line and does not add a concept.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE learn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG learn rank

IMPULSE learn 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "learn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
